      "translation": "返回 <a href=\"../../core/TypeInformation.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.core\"><code>TypeInformation</code></a> 接口，对应于 <a href=\"MappingContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.context\"><code>MappingContext</code></a> 中所有 <a href=\"../PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a> 接口。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns a <a href=\"../PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a> for the given <a href=\"../../core/TypeInformation.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.core\"><code>TypeInformation</code></a>.",
      "translation": "返回给定<a href=\"../../core/TypeInformation.html\" title=\"接口在 org.springframework.data.core\"><code>TypeInformation</code></a>的<a href=\"../PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"接口在 org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns all <a href=\"../PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentProperty</code></a>s for the given path expression based on the given <a href=\"../../core/PropertyPath.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.core\"><code>PropertyPath</code></a>.",
      "translation": "返回给定<a href=\"../PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mapping 中的接口\"><code>PersistentProperty</code></a>路径表达式的所有属性，该路径表达式基于给定的<a href=\"../../core/PropertyPath.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.core 中的接口\"><code>PropertyPath</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns whether the <a href=\"MappingContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.context\"><code>MappingContext</code></a> currently contains a <a href=\"../PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a> for the type.",
      "translation": "返回当前 <a href=\"MappingContext.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mapping.context 中的接口\"><code>MappingContext</code></a> 是否包含类型为 <a href=\"../PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mapping 中的接口\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a> 的实体。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns all <a href=\"../PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a>s held in the context.",
      "translation": "返回上下文中持有的所有<a href=\"../PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mapping 中的接口\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "the <a href=\"../PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a> mapped by the given <a href=\"../PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentProperty</code></a> or null if no\n        <a href=\"../PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a> exists for it or the <a href=\"../PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentProperty</code></a> does not refer to an entity (the\n        type of the property is considered simple see\n        <a href=\"../model/SimpleTypeHolder.html#isSimpleType(java.lang.Class)\"><code>SimpleTypeHolder.isSimpleType(Class)</code></a>).",
      "translation": "由给定<a href=\"../PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentProperty</code></a>映射的<a href=\"../PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a>，或者如果不存在对应的<a href=\"../PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a>或该<a href=\"../PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentProperty</code></a>不引用实体（即属性类型被视为简单类型，参见\n<a href=\"../model/SimpleTypeHolder.html#isSimpleType(java.lang.Class)\"><code>SimpleTypeHolder.isSimpleType(Class)</code></a>），则为 null。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "the <a href=\"../PersistentPropertyPath.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentPropertyPath</code></a> representing the given property path on the given type.",
      "translation": "表示给定类型上给定属性路径的<a href=\"../PersistentPropertyPath.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentPropertyPath</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
