    {
      "source": "Returns a required <a href=\"../PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a> for the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Class</code></a>. Will throw\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/IllegalArgumentException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>IllegalArgumentException</code></a> for types that are considered simple ones.",
      "translation": "返回给定 <a href=\"../PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a> 接口所需的实例。对于被视为简单类型的类，将抛出 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/IllegalArgumentException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>IllegalArgumentException</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns a <a href=\"../PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a> for the given <a href=\"../../core/TypeInformation.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.core\"><code>TypeInformation</code></a>. Will throw\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/IllegalArgumentException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>IllegalArgumentException</code></a> for types that are considered simple ones.",
      "translation": "返回给定 <a href=\"../PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a> 的实例，该实例对应于指定的 <a href=\"../../core/TypeInformation.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.core\"><code>TypeInformation</code></a>。对于被视为简单类型的情况，将抛出 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/IllegalArgumentException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>IllegalArgumentException</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns a <a href=\"../PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a> for the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Class</code></a>. Will return <code>null</code> for types that are\nconsidered simple ones.",
      "translation": "返回给定<a href=\"../PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a>的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Class</code></a>。对于被视为简单类型的情况，将返回<code>null</code>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns a <a href=\"../PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a> for the given <a href=\"../../core/TypeInformation.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.core\"><code>TypeInformation</code></a>. Will return <code>null</code> for types that\nare considered simple ones.",
      "translation": "返回给定<a href=\"../PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mapping 中的接口\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a>的实例。对于被视为简单类型的情况，将返回<code>null</code>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns all <a href=\"../PersistentPropertyPath.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentPropertyPath</code></a>s pointing to properties on the given type that match the given\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/Predicate.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.function\"><code>Predicate</code></a>.",
      "translation": "返回所有指向给定类型上匹配给定<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/Predicate.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.function\"><code>Predicate</code></a>的属性的<a href=\"../PersistentPropertyPath.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentPropertyPath</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns a <a href=\"../PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a> for the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Class</code></a>.",
      "translation": "返回给定<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"类或接口在 java.lang\"><code>Class</code></a>的<a href=\"../PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mapping 中的接口\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns a required <a href=\"../PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a> for the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Class</code></a>.",
      "translation": "返回给定<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"类或接口在 java.lang\"><code>Class</code></a>的必需<a href=\"../PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mapping 中的接口\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns all <a href=\"../PersistentPropertyPath.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentPropertyPath</code></a>s pointing to properties on the given type that match the given\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/Predicate.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.function\"><code>Predicate</code></a>. In case of circular references the detection will stop at the property that references a type\nthat's already included in the path. Note, that is a potentially expensive operation as results cannot be cached.",
      "translation": "返回所有指向给定类型上属性且匹配给定<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/Predicate.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.function\"><code>Predicate</code></a>的<a href=\"../PersistentPropertyPath.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentPropertyPath</code></a>。在存在循环引用的情况下，检测将在引用已包含在路径中的类型的属性处停止。请注意，这是一个潜在昂贵的操作，因为结果无法缓存。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "This interface defines the overall context including all known PersistentEntity instances and methods to obtain\ninstances on demand. it is used internally to establish associations between entities and also at runtime to obtain\nentities by name.",
      "translation": "该接口定义了整体上下文，包括所有已知的持久实体（PersistentEntity）实例以及按需获取这些实例的方法。它在内部用于建立实体之间的关联，并在运行时通过名称获取实体。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
