      "translation": "<code><a href=\"../MappingException.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mapping\">MappingException</a></code> - 当无法为给定的 <a href=\"../../core/TypeInformation.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.core\"><code>TypeInformation</code></a> 找到对应的 <a href=\"../PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a> 时抛出。",
      "count": 1
